---

## What is GitHub?

Cloud platform to store Git repositories.

---

## What is Repository?

Storage location for project code.

---

## What is Commit?

Saving changes in Git.

---

## What is Push?

Uploading local code to GitHub.

---

## Difference Between Git and GitHub?

| Git                  | GitHub                  |
| -------------------- | ----------------------- |
| Version control tool | Online hosting platform |

---

## What is `git init`?

Initializes Git repository.

---

## What is `git add .`?

Adds files for commit.

---

## What is `git commit`?

Saves changes locally.

---

## What is `git push`?

Uploads code to GitHub.

---

## What is Branch?

